===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{senseid|en|Q165494}} {{lb|en|Islam}} The [[call to prayer]], which consisted originally of simply four [[takbir]]s followed by the statement {{m|ar||(أَشْهَدُ أَنْ) لَا إِلٰهَ إِلَّا ٱلله}}.
#: {{ux|en|If one were to pray alone, then no '''adhan''' is needed.}}

